+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On a 5k-record store, the measured `SessionStart` hook latency at p50 was **11.9 ms** before `PRAGMA quick_check` was taken off the read path. After that change, the measured p50 was **1.05 ms**.
+
+The `fts_rows` counter and the body `CHECK` constraint were added at the same time as the read-path change, so this is a measurement of the combined change; it does not isolate the cost or benefit of any one of those three changes.
